        {ATM} 
        {
            {_area} {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild}
            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {An ATM (c) Pinnacle Bank}
                {2} {A small apparatus with a window and many buttons.}
                {3} {You can see that the buttons have words printed on}
                {4} {them with instructions:}
                {5} {balance                    - 0 coins}
                {6} {check                      - 10 coins}
                {7} {deposit <amount> or all    - 15 coins}
                {8} {withdraw <amount>          - 0 coins}
                {9} {transfer <amt> to <player> - 25 coins}
                {10} {transfer block             - free, (un)blocks transfers}
                {11} {<player> must be in game}
                {12} {(c) Pinnacle Bank of 3-Kingdoms}
            }
            {id} {atm}
            {location} 
            {
                {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild} 
                {
                    {73} {}
                }
            }
            {name} {An ATM (c) Pinnacle Bank}
        }
        {^A Tome of 'Enhancing Enchanting', Volume I$} 
        {
            {_area} {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild}
            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {A Tome of 'Enhancing Enchanting', Volume I}
                {2} {The many colours on this gaudy book dance before your very eyes.  Every}
                {3} {now and then the colours condense to form words of power describing}
                {4} {methods to infuse gems with incredible power.  The most common word}
                {5} {formed seems to be 'SEBASTIEN', over and over again.  And over again. }
                {6} {Perhaps you can read it?}
                {7} {Tradeskill : Enchanter}
                {8} {Minimum Skill: 1}
                {9} {Trivial Skill: 33}
                {10} {It looks light.}
            }
            {id} {tome}
            {location} 
            {
                {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild} 
                {
                    {41} {}
                }
            }
            {name} {A Tome of 'Enhancing Enchanting', Volume I}
            {weight} {1}
        }
        {^A Trashcan$} 
        {
            {_area} {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild}
            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {A Trashcan}
                {2} {Use this trashcan to dispose of any garbage. By doing your part to}
                {3} {help make 3k a cleaner, thus better place, brings rewards to all}
                {4} {loyal citizens. To do this type: dispose <item> for single items}
                {5} {and dispose <all> for all unkept items.}
                {6} {Note: Typing dispose all will dispose all unkept items so make sure}
                {7} {you type keep <item> for the things you want to keep. Also}
                {8} {typing dispose all will not get rid of guild objects or other}
                {9} {items that cannot be dropped. Any problems mail Rastafan.}
            }
            {id} {trashcan}
            {location} 
            {
                {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild} 
                {
                    {46} {}
                    {47} {}
                }
            }
            {name} {A Trashcan}
        }
        {^A big red button$} 
        {
            {_area} {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild}
            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {A big red button}
                {2} {This is a big red button that you can press.  Pressing this button}
                {3} {will give you experience points.  The button gives you experience}
                {4} {points so that you can level up to a moderate level with ease and}
                {5} {without upsetting the game balance.  This button is 'at will' so that}
                {6} {people who would rather experience the game as-intended, you can}
                {7} {ignore it.  Each press of the button increases the amount of XP you}
                {8} {gain on that press.  With great power comes great responsibility...}
            }
            {id} {big red button}
            {location} 
            {
                {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild} 
                {
                    {3} {}
                }
            }
            {name} {A big red button}
        }
