        {^Bron, the Blacksmith of Dragon Isle$} 
        {
            {_area} {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild}
            {alignment} {2}
            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {Bron, the Blacksmith of Dragon Isle}
                {2} {Bron is a tall, burly man with long, frizzled steel-grey hair.  His skin}
                {3} {has been burnished to a coppery sheen by his long hours at the forge,}
                {4} {the copper colour in stark contrast to his deep blue eyes.  He is quite}
                {5} {massive, his muscles strengthened by the hard labour that he has made}
                {6} {his life.  It is said that none can best him at his specialty, crafting}
                {7} {armour from the hide and scales of dragons. He could probably teach you}
                {8} {a lot about armour.}
                {9} {It is in perfect health.}
                {10} {Bron is carrying:}
                {11} {<W`A smith's hammer (wielded)`>.}
            }
            {id} {Bron}
            {location} 
