                {1} {Duncan, Keeper of the Dead}
                {2} {Duncan is the keeper over the ancient necromantic crypts. His valor}
                {3} {for the guild is legendary. He was the first necromancer to control}
                {4} {his necromantic powers to properly preserve a corpse. Now with great}
                {5} {honor, he has been given control over the crypts. So if you have a}
                {6} {question about them, he probably can answer it for you.}
                {7} {He is in perfect health.}
                {8} {Duncan is carrying:}
