            {attacks} {}
            {autokill} {-1}
            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {As you gaze up at the statue a feeling of awe and wonderment fills your}
                {2} {being.  Of a small human form comes such energy that fills your heart}
                {3} {with}
                {4} {excitement.  The Saint of the Dead, Rachlan, sits in his chair watching}
                {5} {over each pure necromancer, following them through their struggles with}
                {6} {life and death.  Your eyes fall upon the face of the statue, noticing}
                {7} {the}
                {8} {deep lines around the mouth, eyes and forehead.  It's the eyes that}
                {9} {catch}
