                {1} {Thanamere, Keeper of the scrolls}
                {2} {This is Thanamere, keeper of Scrolls. He stands behind the counter,}
                {3} {waiting to serve his brothers and sisters. He tells you: 'Do not misuse}
                {4} {me and I will help you in your quest for glory, use me for other than}
                {5} {my intent and you still pay the price!' Can this be the same Thanamere}
                {6} {that the Necromancer books speak of, the one who died and was brought}
                {7} {back to life?}
                {8} {He is in perfect health.}
            }
