            {autokill} {-1}
            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {Theela the Necromancer (moral)}
                {2} {Theela smiles at you, though you can see the sadness and anger }
                {3} {she's holding inside.  Even her pretty features are dulled slightly }
                {4} {by the welling of emotion she tries to hold inside.  Even as you }
                {5} {wonder why she holds such grief, you remember that Theela is the }
                {6} {sister of the missing necromancer Kitana.  Her grief can only be }
                {7} {for her missing sister.}
                {8} {She is in perfect health.}
                {9} {Theela is carrying:}
                {10} {<O`An ancient parchment`>.}
                {11} {<W`Necromancer Rod`>.}
            }
