            {
                {1} {Whisper-to the Ghoul}
                {2} {A small ghoul, with huge brown eyes. Is that a}
                {3} {bushy tail? ..No it can't be.. But you can swear}
                {4} {you hear the rustle of leaves and the singing of}
                {5} {birds. Or maybe you're hallucinating. But no}
                {6} {matter, this little ghoul craves a bit of gossip.}
                {7} {And with those ears, Whisper-to can eavesdrop too.}
                {8} {It is in perfect health.}
