        {
            {_area} {Pinnacle/Fantasy/Necromancer Guild}
            {alignment} {4}
            {attacks} {}
            {autokill} {-1}
            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {Wythe the Moneylender (serene)}
                {2} {Wythe is the moneylender of the Necromancer's guild. She}
                {3} {spends her time in this office, and is very willing to}
                {4} {assist you with whatever transactions you wish to make.}
                {5} {It would not be wise to attack her, for she is very}
                {6} {adept at defending herself.}
                {7} {She is in perfect health.}
                {8} {Wythe is carrying:}
                {9} {<W`Necromancer Rod`>.}
                {10} {<L`This is the receiving room for the Necromancers' Guild.  It is a main}
                {11} {gathering point for necromancers so it is lavishly furnished for}
                {12} {comfort.  The main guild board is here for your perusal and you can}
                {13} {type 'restore' if you have problems with your guild object.`>}
                {14} {There are three obvious exits: south, west, east                       }
                {15} {<M`Dedicated the Wight`>.}
                {16} {<M`Packy the packmule`>.}
                {17} {<P`8th Persistence the relentless keeper of fury (38) (neutral)`>.}
                {18} {<O`The Necromancers' Tapestry honoring Dracula`>.}
                {19} {<O`The Necromancers' Board containing 374 messages (no unread}
                {20} {messages)`>.}
