            {desc} 
            {
                {1} {A ghast under the control of Vax}
                {2} {This creature is vaguely recognizable as once having been human, }
                {3} {but it has become horribly disfigured. Its tongue is long and }
                {4} {tough\; for licking the marrow from bones, the teeth are sharp and }
                {5} {elongated, its nails are strong and as sharp as claws. A rotting }
                {6} {stench exudes from this creature, causing retching and nausea to }
                {7} {all within ten feet of the creature.}
                {8} {It is in perfect health.}
                {9} {Ghast is carrying:}
                {10} {<O`(----*) a preserved, glowing corpse of Charging ram`>.}
                {11} {<O`(---|-) a preserved, glowing corpse of Red rabbit`>.}
                {12} {<O`(----*) a preserved, glowing corpse of Purple butterfly`>.}
                {13} {<O`(----*) a preserved, brainless corpse of Red butterfly`>.}
                {14} {<O`(--|--) a preserved, sliced up corpse of Angus the farming}
                {15} {cow`>.}
                {16} {<O`(---|-) a preserved, sliced up corpse of Billy`>.}
                {17} {<O`(---|-) a preserved, crushed corpse of Snowbeast`>.}
                {18} {A valithyn drifts in on a ghostly vapor.}
            }
